  (text "OO-1 video card, prototype carrier: an iCESugar-Pro module (LFE5U-25F, 32 MB SDRAM) in a DDR2 SODIMM-200\nsocket, with the OO-1 bus interface, DVI and VGA outputs and clocks. See hw/video-card-hw.md."
